DATA NOTICE

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository. The input data is
not part of the code license. It is downloaded by `python -m ilredistrict fetch`
from the original publishers, and each file keeps its own terms:

* U.S. Census Bureau 2020 PL 94-171 redistricting data, TIGER/Line 2020 voting
  districts and 2022 state legislative district files: U.S. government works,
  public domain.
* Dave's Redistricting (DRA) precinct election data (github.com/dra2020/vtd_data):
  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0). Election-derived
  columns in results/ (vote totals and margins) are adaptations of that data
  and are shared under CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution to DRA.
* OpenElections Illinois results (github.com/openelections/openelections-data-il):
  see that project's terms; it publishes certified official results.

Maps and tables in results/ that contain no election data are released under MIT
along with the code.
